It might make for an interesting item.  What should happen, I ask, if
salt is dipped into various potions?  Could this be used to add onto
the alchemy system?  It could make the fairly limited #dip command more
universally useful.

Are there useful interactions to be implemented between salt and the
Potion of Acid?  Is there some way that using salt water as an
electrolyte could be useful?

If salt's to be put into the game, then it should have a good number of
interesting effects that will be intuitive, not just to the average
player, but those who know something about chemistry.  It's not
important to be extremely accurate here, but any reasonable assumptions
a player might have should be considered.

